{"code": "SS-Y3-T3-L02", "en": false, "slides": [{"bg": "1E3A3F", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 64, "y": 58, "w": 1152, "h": 58, "text": "الدِّراساتُ الاجْتِماعِيَّةُ وَالتَّرْبِيَةُ الأَخْلاقِيَّةُ · الصَّفُّ الثّالِثُ · الوَحْدَةُ الْخامِسَةُ: الْمُناخُ وَالْخِدْماتُ في بِلادي", "size": 25, "color": "F2A93B", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 128, "w": 832, "h": 134, "text": "الْمُناخُ", "size": 78, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 269, "w": 832, "h": 64, "text": "الدَّرْسُ الْأَوَّلُ: مُناخُ بِلادي · ثانِيًا · كِتابي ص 17–20", "size": 28, "color": "CFE3E1", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 51, "y": 128, "w": 333, "h": 256, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T3-L02/latitude.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": 64, "y": 442, "w": 1152, "h": 186, "fill": "27474D", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 90, "y": 454, "w": 1101, "h": 160, "text": "🎯 أَعْرِفُ أَنَّ الْمُناخَ حالَةُ الْجَوِّ مِنْ حَرارَةٍ وَأَمْطارٍ وَرِياحٍ خِلالَ فَتْرَةٍ زَمَنِيَّةٍ طَويلَةٍ، وَأَنَّ بِلادي تَقَعُ في الْمِنْطَقَةِ الْمَدارِيَّةِ وَيَسودُها الْمُناخُ الصَّحْراوِيُّ الْحارُّ، وَأَصِفُ تَأْثيرَ الْعَوامِلِ الْمُؤَثِّرَةِ في الْمُناخِ: دَوائِرِ الْعَرْضِ وَتَوْزيعِ الْيابِسِ وَالْماءِ وَالتَّضاريسِ.", "size": 32, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}], "n": "اقرأ العنوان بصوت واضح، واطلب من الطلاب فتح الكتاب على الصفحة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🔁 نتذكّر معًا", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 3 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "الطَّقْسُ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 الْمُناخُ · دَوائِرُ الْعَرْضِ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 650, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 275, "rv": 1, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 665, "y": 168, "w": 561, "h": 51, "rv": 1, "text": "🌤️ الطَّقْسُ", "size": 27, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 665, "y": 221, "w": 561, "h": 204, "rv": 1, "text": "حالَةُ الْجَوِّ لِفَتْرَةٍ …", "size": 36, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 275, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "6B46A8", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 168, "w": 561, "h": 51, "rv": 2, "text": "❄️ الشِّتاءُ", "size": 27, "color": "6B46A8", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 221, "w": 561, "h": 204, "rv": 2, "text": "مِنْ … إِلى …", "size": 36, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 461, "w": 1203, "h": 166, "rv": 3, "text": "الطَّقْسُ يَتَغَيَّرُ يَوْمِيًّا… فَماذا نُسَمّي حالَةَ الْجَوِّ عَلى مَدى سَنَواتٍ؟", "size": 32, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[استرجاع التعلّم السابق] اسأل شفويًّا، واستمع لثلاث إجابات، ثم اكشف الجملة الأخيرة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "✨ لحظة فضول", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 4 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "ثُلوجٌ في الْإِماراتِ!", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 الْمُناخُ · دَوائِرُ الْعَرْضِ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 883, "y": 160, "w": 358, "h": 333, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T2-L08/phys.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 819, "h": 96, "text": "❄️ في يَنايِرَ 2020م غَطَّتِ الثُّلوجُ قِمَّةَ جَبَلِ جَيْسٍ في رَأْسِ الْخَيْمَةِ!", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 262, "w": 819, "h": 122, "rv": 1, "text": "كَيْفَ تَتَساقَطُ الثُّلوجُ في بَلَدٍ حارٍّ؟", "size": 32, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 397, "w": 819, "h": 96, "rv": 2, "text": "💬 أُفَكِّرُ وَحْدي ← أُخْبِرُ زَميلي ← نُشارِكُ الصَّفَّ.", "size": 28, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 518, "w": 1203, "h": 122, "rv": 3, "text": "الْمُناخُ وَالْعَوامِلُ الْمُؤَثِّرَةُ فيهِ", "size": 36, "color": "B42318", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "FCE9DA", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[التهيئة وإثارة الدافعية] فكّر – زاوج – شارك. لا تكشف الإجابة قبل أن يخمّن الطلاب."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🎯 وجهتنا اليوم", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 2 دقيقة", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "وِجْهَتُنا الْيَوْمَ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 الْمُناخُ · دَوائِرُ الْعَرْضِ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 1203, "h": 128, "text": "🎯 أَعْرِفُ أَنَّ الْمُناخَ حالَةُ الْجَوِّ مِنْ حَرارَةٍ وَأَمْطارٍ وَرِياحٍ خِلالَ فَتْرَةٍ زَمَنِيَّةٍ طَويلَةٍ، وَأَنَّ بِلادي تَقَعُ في الْمِنْطَقَةِ الْمَدارِيَّةِ وَيَسودُها الْمُناخُ الصَّحْراوِيُّ الْحارُّ، وَأَصِفُ تَأْثيرَ الْعَوامِلِ الْمُؤَثِّرَةِ في الْمُناخِ: دَوائِرِ الْعَرْضِ وَتَوْزيعِ الْيابِسِ وَالْماءِ وَالتَّضاريسِ.", "size": 25, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 853, "y": 307, "w": 388, "h": 333, "rv": 1, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "A35E24", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 869, "y": 315, "w": 358, "h": 51, "rv": 1, "text": "⭐ مُبْتَدِئٌ", "size": 27, "color": "A35E24", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 869, "y": 369, "w": 358, "h": 261, "rv": 1, "text": "أُعَرِّفُ الْمُناخَ وَدَوائِرَ الْعَرْضِ.", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 446, "y": 307, "w": 388, "h": 333, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "5F6C78", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 461, "y": 315, "w": 358, "h": 51, "rv": 2, "text": "⭐⭐ مُتَطَوِّرٌ", "size": 27, "color": "5F6C78", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "v